+## Checking your budgets
+
+The `budget` command shows how much you have spent in each category for a month
+alongside the limits you have configured, so you can see at a glance where you
+are over or under:
+
+```
+python -m tally.cli budget --month 2024-03
+```
+
+Category budgets are set in the configuration file. Any category that has no
+configured limit is listed without a target.
+
